m_of_world_line.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Views of spacetime along the world line of a rapidly accelerating observer in a relativistic universe. The events (\"dots\") that pass the two diagonal lines in the bottom half of the image (the past light cone of the observer in the origin) are the events visible to the observer.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALorentz_transform_of_world_line.gif"}],"sounds":{}}}